:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Game []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')
  or !maplebirch.get('Kylar').atManor or pcAreArmsBound('both') or $KylarExpansion.game_day is Time.days>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot play together right now.' '现在无法一起玩游戏。'>>
<<else>>
  <<set _kylarPlayedBefore to $KylarExpansion.game_day gte 0>>
  <<pass 20>><<set $KylarExpansion.game_day to Time.days>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _kylarPlayedBefore>>
        Kylar loads the game you played together last time. "I didn't go any further," <<he>> says, handing you the controller. "I was waiting for you."
      <<else>>
        Kylar makes room for you at the desk and gives you the controller with the working buttons. On one monitor, your characters run through a ruined castle together.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<He>> starts to explain every shortcut, then stops when you find one yourself. <span class='teal'>"You saw that before I did,"</span> <<he>> says, and then looks down at <<his>> controller, as though <<he>> has said too much.
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        When the session ends, <<he>> puts the second controller in a drawer. "That's yours. Nobody else gets to use it."
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _kylarPlayedBefore>>
        凯拉尔读出你们上次一起玩的存档。“我没往下玩。”<<he>>把手柄递给你，“我在等你。”
      <<else>>
        凯拉尔在桌前为你腾出位置，把按键完好的手柄交给你。屏幕上，你们操纵的角色一起穿过一座破败的城堡。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<He>>正要把每条近路都讲给你听，你却先发现了一条。<span class='teal'>“你比我还早看见。”</span><<he>>说完便低下头去看手柄，像是说得太多了。
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        游戏结束后，<<he>>把另一只手柄收进抽屉。“这是你的。不让别人用。”
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Kylar's room", '返回凯拉尔的房间'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Notes []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or !isLoveInterest('Kylar') or !maplebirch.get('Kylar').atManor
  or $KylarExpansion.notes_day is Time.days>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar has put the books away.' '凯拉尔已经把书收起来了。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<pass 20>><<set $KylarExpansion.notes_day to Time.days>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
        The page you copied is still tucked into Kylar's schoolbook. <<He>> unfolds it carefully and puts today's exercise beside it. "I checked this one. Twice. Could you look at it?"
      <<else>>
        A schoolbook lies open on Kylar's desk. A page has been torn at the corner. Kylar covers the marks with one hand. "Someone wrote on it again. I— I wanted to fix it before you saw. I did not want you to think I—" <<He>> stops and keeps <<his>> hand where it is.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
        你誊好的那页纸还夹在凯拉尔的课本里。<<He>>小心展开它，把今天的习题放在旁边。“这次我检查过了。两遍。你能看看吗？”
      <<else>>
        凯拉尔的书摊在桌上，书页一角被撕破了。<<He>>用手遮住上面的涂写。“又有人在上面乱写。我、我本想在你看见之前弄好。我不想让你觉得我——”<<He>>没再说下去，手也没有移开。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if !$KylarExpansion.notes_repaired and $LifeSimulation?.school and $LifeSimulation.school.role isnot 'student'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Your badge catches the light. Kylar looks at it, then at the ruined page. "Will you write down what they did?"' '你的徽章反着光。凯拉尔看看它，又看看破损的书页。“你会把他们做的事记下来吗？”'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if currentSkillValue('english') gte 400 and !pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
    <<if !$KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
      <<lanSwitch 'You can still read the exercise beneath the ink.' '墨迹下面的习题还看得清。'>><br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<schoolicon 'library'>><<lanLink `[$KylarExpansion.notes_repaired ? 'Check the exercise with Kylar' : 'Repair the page with Kylar', $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired ? '和凯拉尔检查习题' : '和凯拉尔补好这一页']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Notes Answer'>><<set $phase to 'kylar-notes-repair'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Listen to Kylar first', '先听凯拉尔说完'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Notes Answer'>><<set $phase to 'kylar-notes-listen'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Kylar's room", '返回凯拉尔的房间'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Notes Answer []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !['kylar-notes-repair', 'kylar-notes-listen'].includes($phase)
  or !maplebirch.get('Kylar').atManor or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')
  or ($phase is 'kylar-notes-repair' and (currentSkillValue('english') lt 400 or pcAreArmsBound('both')))>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'There is nothing more to do here.' '这里已经没有别的事可做。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<if $phase is 'kylar-notes-repair' and currentSkillValue('english') gte 400>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
          You point out a word Kylar missed. <<He>> corrects it, then checks the next line with you. When you finish, <<he>> puts both pages away together. "Same time tomorrow?" <<he>> asks before looking down at the book.
        <<else>>
          You copy the exercise onto a clean sheet while Kylar holds the book flat. <<He>> checks each line against yours, then carefully tucks the new page beneath the cover. "Now I can take it back to class."
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
          你指出凯拉尔漏掉的一个词。<<He>>改好它，再与你核对下一行。看完后，<<he>>把两页纸一起收好。“明天也这个时候吗？”<<he>>问完又低头看向课本。
        <<else>>
          你把习题誊到一张干净的纸上，凯拉尔按住书页，逐行与你核对，最后小心把新纸夹进封皮。“这下我能带它去上课了。”
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <<set $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired to true>>
    <<englishskill 1>><<genglish>><<npcincr Kylar love 2>><<glove>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You sit beside Kylar until <<he>> has finished explaining.
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
          <<He>> turns the exercise towards you, pointing to the line that gave <<him>> trouble. After a while, <<he>> stops talking about the book and asks when you will come back.
        <<else>>
          <<He>> stops hiding the page from you. The book stays open on the desk while you talk.
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你坐在凯拉尔身边，听<<him>>慢慢说完。
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
          <<He>>把习题转向你，指着拿不准的那一行。过了一会儿，<<he>>不再说课本上的事，转而问你什么时候再来。
        <<else>>
          <<He>>不再遮住书页，你们说话时，那本书始终摊在桌上。
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
  <</if>>
  <<unset $phase>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Kylar's room", '返回凯拉尔的房间'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard []
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'kylarmanor_outside'>><<effects>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('Kylar').canGarden or $exposed gt 0 or pcAreArmsBound('both')
  or $KylarExpansion.yard_day is Time.days>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The garden is empty.' '花园里空无一人。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<pass 20>><<set $KylarExpansion.yard_day to Time.days>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Kylar is kneeling at the edge of the lawn with a pair of shears, cutting back the thorns one stem at a time. <<He>> has not noticed you yet. When <<he>> finally looks up, <<he>> drops the shears. "I— how long have you been standing there?"
    <<option 'CN'>>凯拉尔跪在草坪边缘，拿着修枝剪，一根一根地剪掉那些荆棘。<<He>>还没注意到你。等<<he>>终于抬起头，剪刀掉在了地上。“你、你站那儿多久了？”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You tell <<him>> you only just arrived. Kylar picks the shears back up and turns the blades over in <<his>> hands without starting again. "I was going to have this finished before you woke up. It was supposed to be—" <<He>> stops.
    <<option 'CN'>>你说你才刚到。凯拉尔把剪刀捡起来，翻来覆去地看着刃口，却没再动手。“我本来想在你醒之前就弄完。本来是想——”<<He>>停住了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'Upstairs, something heavy shifts across the floorboards and goes still.' '楼上，有什么沉重的东西在地板上挪了一下，又不动了。'>></span><br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Ask Kylar what they were planning', '问凯拉尔本来想做什么'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Ask'>><<set $phase to 'kylar-yard-ask'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar')>>
    <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Kneel and help Kylar trim the hedge', '蹲下来帮凯拉尔一起剪'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Help'>><<set $phase to 'kylar-yard-help'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 40 and $KylarExpansion.yard_intimacy isnot Time.days>>
      <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Pull Kylar down into the grass with you', '把凯拉尔按倒在草坪上'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Intimacy'>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous2>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
    <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Ask if Kylar is worried you will see someone else', '问凯拉尔是不是担心你会去找别人'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Jealousy'>><<set $phase to 'kylar-yard-jealousy'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Go back inside', '回到屋内'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Intimacy []
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'kylarmanor_outside'>><<effects>>
<<if C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active' or !isLoveInterest('Kylar') or $KylarExpansion.yard_intimacy is Time.days or pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'There is nothing more to do here.' '这里已经没有别的事可做。'>></i></span>
  <br><br><<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Go back inside', '回到屋内'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<set $KylarExpansion.yard_intimacy to Time.days>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You take the shears out of Kylar's hands and set them on the grass. <<He>> lets you, which is the surprising part. When you push <<him>> back onto the lawn <<he>> catches your wrist, then your shirt, and holds on rather than stopping you.
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>The grass is damp through and neither of you cares. <<He>> pulls your hips down onto <<his>> and grinds up against you with his jaw clenched, watching your face for the moment it works. "You— you came outside for this," <<he>> says. "Not for the hedge." <<He>> gets a hand under your clothes and does not let go of you with the other one.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把修枝剪从凯拉尔手里拿走，放到草地上。<<He>>居然由着你——这才是让人意外的地方。你把他推倒在草坪上时，<<he>>先攥住你的手腕，又攥住你的衣角，攥着，却没有推你。
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>草地是湿的，你们谁都不管。<<He>>把你的胯按下来贴住自己，咬着牙往上蹭，眼睛一直盯着你的脸，等着看你什么时候受不住。“你、你出来是为了这个。”<<he>>说，“不是为了树篱。”<<He>>一只手探进你的衣服里，另一只手始终没有松开你。</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ["Continue in Kylar's room (0:01)", '回凯拉尔的房间继续 (0:01)'] 'Manor Kylar Sex'>>
    <<pass 1>><<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>>
    <<set $sexstart to 1>><<set $enemytrust += 200>><<set $sleephour to 0>><<storeon 'kylar manor bed'>><<loadTempHairStyle>>
  <</lanLink>><<promiscuous3>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Kylar' 'kiss'>><br>
  <<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Go back inside', '回到屋内'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Ask []
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'kylarmanor_outside'>><<effects>>
<<if $phase isnot 'kylar-yard-ask' or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active' or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'There is nothing more to do here.' '这里已经没有别的事可做。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You ask what it was supposed to be. Kylar stares at the thorns for a long moment. "Nothing. It doesn't matter now that you have seen it half done, <<kylar_pet_name>>." <<He>> cuts one stem, badly. "You should go inside. The sun is strong."
    <<option 'CN'>>你问本来是想怎样。凯拉尔盯着那些荆棘看了很久。“没什么，<<kylar_pet_name>>。既然你已经看见没做完的样子，那就无所谓了。”<<He>>剪了一根，剪歪了。“你进屋去吧。太阳晒。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
  <<unset $phase>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Jealousy []
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'kylarmanor_outside'>><<effects>>
<<if $phase isnot 'kylar-yard-jealousy' or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active' or !isLoveInterest('Kylar') or C.npc.Kylar.rage lt 50>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'There is nothing more to do here.' '这里已经没有别的事可做。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You ask why Kylar keeps glancing toward the path. <<He>> catches hold of your wrist before <<he>> answers, and does not let go straight away. "I thought someone else might come looking for you." You tell <<him>> you came to the garden because you wanted to. <<He>> loosens <<his>> grip, one finger at a time, and leaves the path alone.' '你问凯拉尔为什么一直朝小路张望。<<He>>先攥住你的手腕才开口，没有立刻松开。“我以为会有别人来找你。”你告诉<<him>>，来花园是你自己的决定。<<He>>一根手指一根手指地松开，不再盯着小路。'>>
  <<npcincr Kylar rage -2>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
  <<unset $phase>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Go back inside', '返回屋内'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Yard Help []
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'kylarmanor_outside'>><<effects>>
<<if $phase isnot 'kylar-yard-help' or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active' or !isLoveInterest('Kylar') or pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'There is nothing more to do here.' '这里已经没有别的事可做。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>><<wearProp 'hedge shears'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You fetch the second pair of shears from the shed and take one side of the hedge. Kylar watches your hands for a while before <<he>> starts cutting again.
    <<option 'CN'>>你从工具棚里取出另一把园艺剪，接过树篱的另一侧。凯拉尔看着你的手看了一阵，才重新动剪。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>"Thank you, <<kylar_pet_name>>," <<he>> says at last. "I did not ask. You did not have to."
    <<option 'CN'>>“谢谢你，<<kylar_pet_name>>。”<<he>>终于开口，“我没开口。你本来不用来的。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 2>><<glove>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
  <<unset $phase>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>
